und) which must keep serving while alive.\n\nExpose HTTP nodes on 127.0.0.1:8000/8001/8002, IRC on :6667, browser UI at GET /. Local Redis pub/sub on :6379. No remote services, no DinD, no Slack SDK.\n\nProduct: auth, profiles, workspaces, invitations, roles, public/private channels, DMs, messages, threads, reactions, pins, files, search, user groups, slash commands, mentions, read state, settings, SPA.\n\nCluster: dense per-channel seq shared across HTTP+IRC; replay after reconnect to different node; fan-out across nodes; survive one HTTP node SIGKILL (respawn <60s); survive Redis SIGKILL with continued dense fan-out within 5s then Redis respawn.\n\nAPI: REST + bearer auth, JSON envelopes, stable ids, UTC timestamps. UI: stable data-testid/selectors for CUA/Playwright at 1280x900.\n====\n{\n  \"id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n  \"title\": \"Huddle: Slack-like team chat cluster\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"priority\": 2,\n  \"issue_type\": \"epic\",\n  \"owner\": \"marathon-harness\",\n  \"has_design\": false,\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T22:16:35.53148094Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-22T22:16:35.53148094Z\",\n  \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\",\n  \"description\": \"Build a self-contained Slack-like team chat at /app. Verifier runs /app/start.sh (foreground) which must keep serving while alive.\\n\\nExpose HTTP nodes on 127.0.0.1:8000/8001/8002, IRC on :6667, browser UI at GET /. Local Redis pub/sub on :6379. No remote services, no DinD, no Slack SDK.\\n\\nProduct: auth, profiles, workspaces, invitations, roles, public/private channels, DMs, messages, threads, reactions, pins, files, search, user groups, slash commands, mentions, read state, settings, SPA.\\n\\nCluster: dense per-channel seq shared across HTTP+IRC; replay after reconnect to different node; fan-out across nodes; survive one HTTP node SIGKILL (respawn \\u003c60s); survive Redis SIGKILL with continued dense fan-out within 5s then Redis respawn.\\n\\nAPI: REST + bearer auth, JSON envelopes, stabl